WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
It’s impossible for us to chase each other for four years and not feel anything at all.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,320
But feelings and company

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,000
I, Luo Pang, can still tell the difference clearly.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,040
Sorry

5
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:10,160
The people our company is recruiting this time are required to have super good looks.

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,160
you are unqualified

7
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,600
Let’s talk next time when we have a chance

8
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,440
Let’s talk about personal relationships later

9
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,040
Today I will only look at the job requirements

10
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,800
I can't skip the process and arrange it for you

11
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,240
Luo Pang finally woke up

12
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,640
Who you like is a private matter

13
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,040
Recruitment must be fair

14
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,600
Don’t let emotions destroy the company’s system. I understand.

15
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,000
I accept the unified review

16
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,520
If the ability does not meet the job requirements

17
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,160
Also accept the result is good

18
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,320
The results of this round are jointly scored by the interview team

19
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,480
Will be notified later

20
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,760
Not bad, not bad

21
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,040
This fat man has finally grown up

22
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,080
Why is this like this, Luo Ming?

23
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,360
you can't do this

24
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,600
I'm wrong. I'm wrong. Isn't that okay?

25
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,080
I will listen to you from now on

26
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,280
I can let you sleep tonight

27
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,280
Can you just let me pass?

28
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,320
I really need this job

29
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,880
immortal

30
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,320
I used to give blindly

31
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,880
The other party never responded

32
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,720
Now Zhang Tong has made a name for himself

33
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,960
Everyone's attitude has changed
